---
// Layered architecture diagram: game (your code + adapter + SDK) ⇄ decision service ⇄ model provider.
---

<figure class="arch not-content" aria-label="A2G architecture: game, decision service and model provider">
	<div class="col">
		<div class="col-title">Game</div>
		<div class="box game">
			<div class="box-title">Your game</div>
			<div class="box-text">Entities, rules, physics, <strong>native AI (FSM)</strong></div>
		</div>
		<div class="box you">
			<div class="tag">you write</div>
			<div class="box-title">Adapter + manifest</div>
			<div class="box-text"><code>observe</code> · <code>legal_actions</code> · <code>execute</code></div>
		</div>
		<div class="box a2g">
			<div class="tag">A2G provides</div>
			<div class="box-title">Engine SDK</div>
			<div class="box-text">Session, batching, epochs, TTL, reports, telemetry</div>
		</div>
		<div class="box a2g planned">
			<div class="tag">proposed</div>
			<div class="box-title">Local policy</div>
			<div class="box-text">Small model trained on the service's decisions; runs offline</div>
		</div>
	</div>

	<div class="link">
		<span class="arrow">⇄</span>
		<span class="link-label">A2G protocol<br /><small>HTTP · JSON</small></span>
	</div>

	<div class="col">
		<div class="col-title">Decision service</div>
		<div class="box a2g tall">
			<div class="tag">A2G provides</div>
			<div class="box-title">Reference service</div>
			<ul>
				<li>Validates against the manifest</li>
				<li>Keeps per-entity memory</li>
				<li>Holds provider keys</li>
				<li>Debug console</li>
			</ul>
		</div>
	</div>

	<div class="link">
		<span class="arrow">⇄</span>
		<span class="link-label">typed choice<br /><small>provider API</small></span>
	</div>

	<div class="col">
		<div class="col-title">Model</div>
		<div class="box ext tall">
			<div class="box-title">Model provider</div>
			<div class="box-text">Picks one action from the offered list.<br /><small>Reference: OpenAI Decisions</small></div>
		</div>
	</div>
</figure>

<style>
	.arch {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.3fr) auto minmax(0, 1fr) auto minmax(0, 0.9fr);
		align-items: stretch;
		gap: 0.5rem;
		margin: 2rem 0;
		font-size: var(--sl-text-sm);
		line-height: 1.45;
	}
	.col {
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
		gap: 0.5rem;
	}
	.col-title {
		font-size: var(--sl-text-xs);
		font-weight: 600;
		letter-spacing: 0.08em;
		text-transform: uppercase;
		color: var(--sl-color-gray-3);
	}
	.box {
		position: relative;
		padding: 0.75rem 0.85rem;
		border: 1px solid var(--sl-color-gray-5);
		border-radius: 0.6rem;
		background: var(--sl-color-gray-7, var(--sl-color-bg));
	}
	.tall {
		flex: 1;
	}
	.box-title {
		font-weight: 600;
		color: var(--sl-color-white);
	}
	.box-text,
	.box ul {
		color: var(--sl-color-gray-2);
	}
	.box ul {
		margin: 0.35rem 0 0;
		padding-left: 1.1rem;
	}
	.box code {
		font-size: 0.85em;
	}
	.tag {
		float: right;
		margin-left: 0.5rem;
		padding: 0 0.45rem;
		border-radius: 1rem;
		font-size: 0.7rem;
		font-weight: 600;
	}
	.you {
		border-color: var(--sl-color-accent);
		background: var(--sl-color-accent-low);
	}
	.you .tag {
		background: var(--sl-color-accent);
		color: var(--sl-color-black);
	}
	.a2g .tag {
		background: var(--sl-color-gray-5);
		color: var(--sl-color-white);
	}
	.ext,
	.planned {
		border-style: dashed;
	}
	.link {
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
		align-items: center;
		justify-content: center;
		padding-top: 1.5rem;
		text-align: center;
		color: var(--sl-color-gray-3);
	}
	.arrow {
		font-size: 1.6rem;
		line-height: 1;
		color: var(--sl-color-accent);
	}
	.link-label {
		font-size: var(--sl-text-xs);
		white-space: nowrap;
	}
	@media (max-width: 50rem) {
		.arch {
			grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr);
		}
		.link {
			flex-direction: row;
			gap: 0.5rem;
			padding: 0;
		}
		.arrow {
			transform: rotate(90deg);
		}
		.link-label br {
			display: none;
		}
		.link-label small::before {
			content: ' · ';
		}
	}
</style>
